  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of a JSON file holding an array of records, as an API hands them back: .ReadJson(path) in the chain, read.json in a pipeline file, replayed like any other file the pipeline reads. Every value as the file writes it — a number in its own spelling, so 22.0 stays 22.0 — a key a record leaves out and a null both a gap, and a value that is itself an object or a list refused by name, with its record.",
